## Layout philosophy

This repo follows three rules, enforced by lint and reviewed by the agent rules in [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md):

1. **Folder-per-category.** Every feature has the same fixed set of subfolders. No files at a feature root — they live inside one of the prescribed subfolders.
2. **Small files (300–500 lines).** Long files are split into smaller categorised files. `scripts/lint.sh` warns when files exceed the cap (warning-only by default).
3. **Naming convention.** Content is inferable from the suffix: `*.routes.*`, `*.controller.*`, `*.service.*`, `*.types.*`, `*.model.*`, `*.handler.*`, `*.gateway.*`, `*.client.*`, `*.spec.*`.

See [`${SRC_DIR}/README.md`](${SRC_DIR}/README.md) for the per-feature subfolder rule on this platform.

## Quick start

See the platform-specific commands in the stamped `package.json` / `build.gradle.kts` / `app.json` for the exact `dev` / `build` / `test` entrypoints. The high-level shape is the same on every platform:

```bash
# install deps
npm install        # or ./gradlew dependencies for Android

# build smoke test
npm run build      # or ./gradlew assembleDebug

# run tests
npm test           # or ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest

# start dev server (where applicable)
npm run dev        # backend / frontend / mobile
```

